<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-NZ 56-6 AT CLOSE OF FIRST DAY VS ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ 56-6 AT CLOSE OF FIRST DAY VS ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were 56 for six wickets at the end of the first day, shortened to one session, in the second test against England at the Basin Reserve on Thursday.</p>
<p>Score:</p>
<p>New Zealand 56 for six wickets (D.Gough 3-12, A.Caddick 3- 19).</p>
